WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.320 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 15=

01:39.360 --> 01:40.000
Come look over here.

01:41.561 --> 01:42.360
Wait for me!

01:42.440 --> 01:43.360
Stop right there!

01:46.001 --> 01:47.001
Now,

01:47.001 --> 01:48.520
your problem is taken care of.

01:49.880 --> 01:51.120
I wasn't seeing the bigger picture.

01:51.960 --> 01:52.840
Before,

01:53.040 --> 01:54.799
you were being blackmailed by Madam Zuo.

01:55.280 --> 01:57.120
You had the reputations
of Ganlin's young women to protect,

01:57.120 --> 01:58.000
so you couldn't openly help.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.079
As the Art of War says,

02:02.400 --> 02:03.599
ordinary minds plan the move,

02:03.599 --> 02:04.680
and wise minds shape the game.

02:05.239 --> 02:06.079
I, Tingyun,

02:06.599 --> 02:07.680
am truly impressed.

02:09.199 --> 02:10.000
There's more over here.

02:13.439 --> 02:15.520
(Mo Residence)
I was wrong, General.

02:16.719 --> 02:19.639
Please forgive me!

02:20.639 --> 02:23.560
Please come out and see me!

02:23.560 --> 02:24.280
Don't worry.

02:24.639 --> 02:26.280
I won't go soft on her this time.

02:27.520 --> 02:29.960
I was wrong, General!

02:30.919 --> 02:32.879
Please forgive me!

02:39.000 --> 02:39.719
Madam!

02:39.800 --> 02:40.960
Madam!

02:41.039 --> 02:41.840
Madam!

02:42.240 --> 02:43.639
After bringing such disgrace upon us,

02:43.639 --> 02:44.479
you have no place

02:45.120 --> 02:46.520
in this family.

02:46.879 --> 02:48.000
A widow is dead.

02:48.439 --> 02:49.560
Miss Xie said

02:49.960 --> 02:51.120
there's no point

02:51.520 --> 02:52.639
in taking this any further.

02:53.520 --> 02:54.719
Take this silver,

02:55.199 --> 02:56.000
go somewhere else,

02:56.360 --> 02:57.599
and make a decent life for yourself.

02:58.439 --> 02:59.719
I was wrong.

03:19.120 --> 03:19.800
Madam,

03:19.960 --> 03:22.000
Miss Xie really knows
how to work things.

03:22.199 --> 03:24.080
Her man killed Lu Dahu

03:24.080 --> 03:25.199
and still got promoted.

03:25.719 --> 03:27.599
Yet General was the one punished.

03:28.599 --> 03:30.439
Mo's been demoted from third rank
to fourth.

03:32.840 --> 03:34.439
Now my child's future

03:35.599 --> 03:36.400
has even fewer prospects.

03:43.479 --> 03:44.159
Eat some more.

04:16.319 --> 04:17.240
Come sit down.

04:22.920 --> 04:24.160
Mr. Zhao, I was wrong.

04:24.160 --> 04:24.759
Okay?

04:25.199 --> 04:26.160
What's for dinner?

04:30.199 --> 04:31.480
Mr. Zhao, you've really lost weight.

04:33.600 --> 04:34.639
Why do you care?

04:35.759 --> 04:37.240
I'm not your father anyway,

04:37.360 --> 04:38.439
or your brother.

04:39.199 --> 04:40.199
You're Mr. Zhao.

04:40.199 --> 04:41.000
Happy now?

04:41.120 --> 04:42.600
I really was wrong, Mr. Zhao.

04:42.600 --> 04:43.279
I won't do it again.

04:43.279 --> 04:44.079
Again?

04:44.399 --> 04:45.759
If you're sorry, then eat.

04:46.120 --> 04:47.680
Mr. Zhao, you're going to choke me!

04:47.680 --> 04:49.079
Whatever. You're still finishing it.

04:49.079 --> 04:49.680
Got it?

04:50.439 --> 04:52.000
Mr. Zhao, I'm sorry!

04:53.480 --> 04:54.199
(Mother,)

04:54.680 --> 04:56.000
(I am far away in Ganlin,)

04:56.399 --> 04:57.480
(but all is well.)

04:58.519 --> 04:59.639
(Has your cough)

04:59.639 --> 05:00.680
(gotten any better?)

05:01.680 --> 05:03.120
(I've worried about you day and night.)

05:03.680 --> 05:04.800
(Please take good care of yourself.)

05:06.120 --> 05:07.160
Should we tell the Ninth Young Lady

05:07.160 --> 05:08.480
about the Old Madam's passing?

05:13.240 --> 05:15.319
Since she's cut ties with the family,

05:15.920 --> 05:18.040
let her stay free and far away
from all this.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.920
(Zhao Residence)

05:31.160 --> 05:32.839
Your favorite chilled sand-rice cakes.

05:33.040 --> 05:34.839
Zheng San bought them at the market
this morning.

05:34.959 --> 05:35.639
Just leave them there.

05:37.160 --> 05:37.920
Sanniang,

05:38.160 --> 05:40.079
steam two extra baskets
of mixed-grain buns later.

05:40.240 --> 05:42.000
Have Sen take them to the camp
this afternoon.

05:42.720 --> 05:43.720
For lunch,

05:44.000 --> 05:46.439
soak the dried radish until it's soft
and add a little salt.

05:47.040 --> 05:49.160
Blanch the wild greens from the backyard
and make a soup.

05:49.439 --> 05:50.000
And

05:50.399 --> 05:52.639
that salted fish Ms. Zhang
brought yesterday...

05:52.639 --> 05:53.560
just steam half of it.

05:53.560 --> 05:54.279
Let's make it last.

05:54.279 --> 05:55.000
All right.

05:56.079 --> 05:57.240
Sanniang, don't listen to her.

05:58.399 --> 05:59.439
She's always generous

05:59.639 --> 06:00.519
with the men and me,

06:01.600 --> 06:03.040
but stingy with herself.

06:03.160 --> 06:05.079
Mr. Zhao, what are you doing back?

06:08.040 --> 06:09.480
We live in town.

06:09.600 --> 06:10.879
If we want something,

06:10.879 --> 06:12.439
we can always buy it at the market.

06:12.680 --> 06:14.639
We can eat whatever we like
whenever we like.

06:14.920 --> 06:16.439
So of course we should save

06:16.439 --> 06:17.279
the good food for the men.

06:23.199 --> 06:24.839
Aren't you on duty today, Mr. Zhao?

06:25.319 --> 06:26.439
They're issuing grain today.

06:27.079 --> 06:28.360
I left Biao to keep an eye on things
at camp.

06:29.600 --> 06:30.839
I brought a few of the men

06:30.959 --> 06:32.279
back to Ganlin to reinforce the granary

06:33.560 --> 06:34.360
before the sandstorms hit.

06:35.439 --> 06:36.319
And I get

06:36.800 --> 06:37.920
a little break out of it,

06:39.199 --> 06:40.279
with an excuse to come home more often.

06:41.120 --> 06:42.560
The men can tag along

06:43.480 --> 06:44.560
and score a few hot meals too.

07:12.959 --> 07:13.759
Hurry up, everyone!

07:15.040 --> 07:15.639
Okay.

07:26.839 --> 07:28.000
What are you thinking about?

07:28.399 --> 07:29.480
You've got a big smile on your face.

07:29.720 --> 07:30.720
Tonight,

07:31.480 --> 07:32.160
I'm betting

07:34.319 --> 07:35.279
we're getting cured pork.

07:37.199 --> 07:38.319
Keep dreaming.

07:43.240 --> 07:44.040
Let's finish early

07:44.160 --> 07:44.879
and get home early.

07:44.879 --> 07:45.720
You got it!

07:45.800 --> 07:46.240
Come on!

07:50.199 --> 07:51.000
Put your backs into it!

07:51.160 --> 07:51.720
You got it!

07:52.079 --> 07:53.040
Don't worry, Yucheng.

07:55.639 --> 07:56.839
That's incredible.

07:57.439 --> 07:58.600
You said there'd be cured pork,

07:58.600 --> 07:59.720
and there really is!

08:00.399 --> 08:02.040
Someone must've tipped Sanniang off.

08:02.040 --> 08:02.800
Yeah.

08:03.800 --> 08:04.600
What a coincidence.

08:32.679 --> 08:33.320
Mr. Zhao,

08:33.960 --> 08:35.679
Miss Xie saved this specially for you.

08:35.960 --> 08:36.600
Jerky.

08:38.320 --> 08:38.799
Hey,

08:39.320 --> 08:39.960
the flatbread.

08:40.320 --> 08:41.440
You've got enough for the road.

08:41.720 --> 08:42.080
Okay.

09:04.759 --> 09:06.159
He just left like that?

09:20.360 --> 09:21.679
Miss Xie, what are you doing out here?

09:26.039 --> 09:27.720
Mr. Zhao said his promotion

09:27.720 --> 09:28.799
came with a raise,

09:28.879 --> 09:30.519
so he had someone bring you

09:30.519 --> 09:32.080
lotus seeds all the way from Yongning.

09:32.159 --> 09:33.399
By the time they sprout,

09:33.399 --> 09:34.879
he'll be home on leave.

10:29.880 --> 10:33.880
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

10:37.520 --> 10:41.560
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

10:43.560 --> 10:48.240
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

10:48.240 --> 10:48.880
I'm leaving.

10:48.960 --> 10:51.520
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

10:52.640 --> 10:57.080
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

11:00.180 --> 11:07.060
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

11:08.460 --> 11:15.060
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

11:15.560 --> 11:19.160
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

11:19.600 --> 11:23.800
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

11:24.280 --> 11:30.040
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

11:32.640 --> 11:39.280
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

11:39.280 --> 11:40.480
(Frontier Patrol)

11:40.480 --> 11:46.560
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

11:47.280 --> 11:50.600
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

11:51.480 --> 11:55.280
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

11:56.000 --> 12:01.120
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

12:23.320 --> 12:23.919
Miss Xie,

12:24.639 --> 12:25.759
a letter came from the capital.

12:32.120 --> 12:33.279
(The new emperor has ascended
the throne.)

12:33.559 --> 12:34.639
(He is in urgent need of capable men.)

12:37.080 --> 12:37.919
Ascended the throne...

12:49.600 --> 12:50.399
In that case,

12:51.639 --> 12:53.399
Mr. Zhao's promotion
to Battalion Commander

12:54.279 --> 12:55.600
has become more urgent than ever.

13:00.880 --> 13:03.720
(The Capital)

13:06.040 --> 13:08.880
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)

13:14.920 --> 13:17.400
(Yu Guodong, Left Censor-in-Chief
of the Censorate)

13:30.480 --> 13:32.920
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)

13:34.279 --> 13:38.440
Long live Your Majesty!

13:42.480 --> 13:43.720
Your son

13:43.720 --> 13:45.200
is truly an exceptional young man.

13:45.360 --> 13:46.200
Lord Yu,

13:46.200 --> 13:47.480
you've raised him well.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.039
Congratulations.

13:50.480 --> 13:51.639
Doing well in his studies

13:52.200 --> 13:54.159
doesn't mean he'll make a good official.

13:55.399 --> 13:57.840
(Lord Liu, Right Vice Censor-in-Chief)
I hear the Ministry of Personnel

13:57.840 --> 13:58.919
is sending officials
to survey the northwest.

13:59.159 --> 13:59.720
I say

13:59.840 --> 14:01.360
they should take Young Lord Yu along.

14:02.039 --> 14:03.480
He can learn how things work early on,

14:04.320 --> 14:05.799
so when he joins one
of the Six Ministries,

14:05.919 --> 14:07.440
he'll know exactly what he's doing.

14:11.799 --> 14:12.559
If you'll

14:12.879 --> 14:13.559
excuse me.

14:18.960 --> 14:21.480
An inspection tour
is a very lucrative assignment.

14:22.519 --> 14:23.919
Why aren't you interested?

14:25.279 --> 14:26.960
I've benefited from our family's
influence long enough.

14:28.679 --> 14:29.840
From now on,

14:31.279 --> 14:32.440
I want to make my own name at court.

14:34.799 --> 14:36.039
Go home

14:37.679 --> 14:39.519
and see what your mother has to say.

14:42.240 --> 14:44.080
Your father told me today

14:44.320 --> 14:46.919
about an inspection assignment
in the northwest.

14:48.399 --> 14:50.279
I already turned Father down today.

14:50.399 --> 14:50.759
I don't want to...

14:50.759 --> 14:51.480
Good.

14:53.679 --> 14:55.200
Don't follow your father's plan.

14:56.159 --> 14:57.679
Stay right here

14:57.799 --> 14:58.879
and don't go anywhere.

14:59.440 --> 15:01.000
The Emperor has only
just taken the throne,

15:01.000 --> 15:02.559
and he needs capable men around him.

15:02.879 --> 15:04.120
You should stay

15:05.000 --> 15:06.440
at the Hanlin Academy.

15:06.960 --> 15:07.679
For one,

15:07.759 --> 15:09.120
you'll have regular access
to His Majesty.

15:09.240 --> 15:10.080
And for another,

15:10.080 --> 15:11.600
you'll be perfectly placed

15:13.000 --> 15:14.639
to handle confidential documents

15:14.799 --> 15:16.879
and draft imperial edicts.

15:16.960 --> 15:19.480
Those important duties will naturally
fall to someone close to the Emperor.

15:19.799 --> 15:21.840
That's so much better

15:21.840 --> 15:23.039
than trudging around
on inspection tours.

15:24.919 --> 15:26.399
So you absolutely must not go.

15:29.320 --> 15:31.240
Stay in the capital,
attend to your parents,

15:32.200 --> 15:33.840
and serve before His Majesty.

15:34.039 --> 15:35.399
That's the path you should take.

15:48.600 --> 15:49.519
I understand

15:50.200 --> 15:51.080
your concern, Mother.

15:52.879 --> 15:54.840
But something Father said today

15:55.360 --> 15:56.799
made everything clear to me.

15:58.440 --> 16:01.000
For more than twenty years,
this family has raised and protected me.

16:02.360 --> 16:04.480
Now it's time for me to repay that debt.

16:06.440 --> 16:07.600
The inspection may be difficult,

16:08.240 --> 16:08.960
but it would let me

16:09.200 --> 16:10.360
see how the people truly live

16:10.919 --> 16:11.919
and gain real experience.

16:13.799 --> 16:14.559
Besides,

16:15.480 --> 16:16.480
with the Yan family fallen,

16:16.679 --> 16:18.159
if we want to take control
of the northwest salt trade

16:18.159 --> 16:19.279
from Grand Secretary Liu's faction,

16:19.759 --> 16:20.759
we need someone

16:20.960 --> 16:22.840
from our own family whom we can trust.

16:23.679 --> 16:24.559
If I go,

16:24.759 --> 16:26.279
we can accomplish both at once.

16:28.879 --> 16:29.799
I hope, Mother,

16:30.120 --> 16:31.480
you'll allow me to leave.

16:38.320 --> 16:40.120
If you've already made up your mind,

16:41.399 --> 16:43.480
why come tell me all this?

16:44.679 --> 16:45.960
Do as you wish.

16:48.440 --> 16:49.759
Thank you, Mother.

16:52.080 --> 16:53.000
I'll take my leave.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.600
Go tell the master

17:04.559 --> 17:05.880
that I've persuaded him to go.

17:07.240 --> 17:09.200
Have him give the boy
a few more instructions

17:09.200 --> 17:10.279
about the family's important affairs.

17:11.799 --> 17:12.720
Yes, Madam.

17:13.080 --> 17:15.640
(Yu Residence)

17:22.279 --> 17:22.960
Young Madam.

17:29.640 --> 17:30.839
Put these away.

17:35.119 --> 17:36.279
Young Master said not to touch them.

17:36.640 --> 17:37.319
He said

17:37.319 --> 17:38.519
these old books are already damaged,

17:38.519 --> 17:39.440
which is a shame.

17:39.599 --> 17:41.519
He spent ages arranging the order
for restoring them.

17:41.519 --> 17:42.599
If it gets mixed up,

17:42.720 --> 17:44.079
he'll have to start all over again.

17:47.640 --> 17:49.319
But how does any of this
help his career?

17:50.799 --> 17:52.119
Doesn't he read enough

17:52.119 --> 17:53.279
all day at the Hanlin Academy?

17:54.640 --> 17:55.680
Why come home

17:56.279 --> 17:58.359
and waste time on work that isn't
even his responsibility?

18:04.000 --> 18:05.640
If you'd known Madam didn't like them,

18:06.480 --> 18:07.279
you might not have

18:07.279 --> 18:08.799
brought those old books home.

18:14.240 --> 18:15.279
Had I known...

18:16.599 --> 18:18.160
she might never have become Young Madam.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.759
Your personal misconduct

18:23.519 --> 18:25.079
got you demoted by Commander Wang.

18:26.960 --> 18:29.400
You nearly lost your hereditary post
altogether.

18:30.920 --> 18:32.559
With officials coming from the capital
for inspection,

18:33.039 --> 18:34.720
you need to seize the chance

18:34.960 --> 18:36.000
to get your old rank back.

18:36.839 --> 18:38.400
Easy for you to say.

18:39.000 --> 18:41.559
Getting reinstated isn't that simple.

18:42.000 --> 18:43.559
I need merit to my name.

18:43.799 --> 18:45.039
There's no war going on,

18:45.279 --> 18:46.839
so where am I supposed to find

18:46.960 --> 18:48.119
the military merit for a promotion?

18:48.359 --> 18:49.559
There's no need to rush.

18:52.039 --> 18:53.240
No need to rush?

18:54.440 --> 18:56.119
I've already given you three children!

18:57.759 --> 18:58.920
Madam Wang ordered

18:59.440 --> 19:01.599
a formal welcome
for the visiting inspectors.

19:02.960 --> 19:04.279
I pulled a few strings

19:05.119 --> 19:06.319
and got the assignment.

19:07.279 --> 19:08.759
I figured it would give the Mo family

19:09.160 --> 19:11.240
a chance to make a good impression
on the officials.

19:12.079 --> 19:14.079
As long as you don't mess it up,

19:14.680 --> 19:15.480
there'll still be

19:16.000 --> 19:17.400
other chances down the road.

19:20.680 --> 19:21.720
But, my dear,

19:22.359 --> 19:24.079
something just occurred to me.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.200
For the welcome ceremony,

19:26.200 --> 19:27.920
you'll need shehuo performances
and yangge dances.

19:27.920 --> 19:29.240
You're good at arranging
that sort of thing.

19:29.839 --> 19:32.559
But copying out the inspectors' roster

19:32.559 --> 19:34.079
takes a careful hand.

19:34.599 --> 19:35.839
You can't even read.

19:35.839 --> 19:37.160
You know I can't read,

19:38.000 --> 19:39.680
so get one of your men over here
to help.

19:40.359 --> 19:41.880
That won't do.

19:42.039 --> 19:43.400
To copy the roster,

19:43.519 --> 19:44.759
you don't just need to be literate.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.680
You need excellent handwriting too.

19:47.519 --> 19:48.720
Upside down.

19:50.000 --> 19:51.039
That's what I'm saying.

19:51.039 --> 19:53.400
The men in my camp are a rough bunch.

19:53.400 --> 19:55.200
They're no good at delicate work
like this.

19:55.559 --> 19:56.160
So...

19:57.839 --> 19:59.880
you'll have to ask Miss Xie.

20:00.960 --> 20:01.920
Ask her?

20:03.600 --> 20:05.279
(Zhao Residence)

20:05.279 --> 20:07.319
Why is it so unbearably hot today?

20:21.440 --> 20:22.440
Just knock, Madam.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.160
Don't rush me.

20:30.559 --> 20:32.000
Just knock, Madam.

20:33.400 --> 20:34.559
Can't you see I'm burning up?

20:34.559 --> 20:35.559
I'm drenched in sweat.

20:35.559 --> 20:36.759
Let me cool off first.

20:43.279 --> 20:43.920
Madam.

20:44.079 --> 20:45.480
Stop meddling.

20:56.799 --> 20:57.519
Madam,

20:57.680 --> 20:59.000
do you need something?

20:59.599 --> 21:00.119
No.

21:00.880 --> 21:01.720
Nothing in particular.

21:02.559 --> 21:03.440
I was just looking around.

21:03.839 --> 21:04.799
Just looking.

21:06.680 --> 21:08.160
(Visiting Inspectors)

21:12.079 --> 21:14.119
I heard you're in charge

21:14.119 --> 21:15.440
of welcoming the visiting inspectors.

21:15.640 --> 21:16.559
I was wondering

21:16.960 --> 21:18.759
if there's anything I can help with.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.400
Now that you mention it,

21:24.319 --> 21:25.640
there is one thing.

21:26.359 --> 21:26.960
I've

21:26.960 --> 21:28.200
seen a thing or two,

21:28.759 --> 21:29.559
and I'm

21:29.559 --> 21:30.519
pretty thorough when I do things.

21:30.880 --> 21:32.160
I know how to handle myself

21:32.440 --> 21:33.440
in most situations.

21:35.359 --> 21:36.680
But my handwriting

21:37.599 --> 21:38.799
is nothing to brag about.

21:39.759 --> 21:40.759
You're well educated,

21:41.279 --> 21:42.480
and you have beautiful handwriting.

21:43.519 --> 21:45.119
This is the inspectors' roster.

21:45.240 --> 21:46.279
Could you

21:47.519 --> 21:48.599
make a few copies for me?

21:55.640 --> 21:56.799
Since you're asking,

21:57.119 --> 21:57.920
of course

21:57.920 --> 21:59.200
I'll be happy to help.

21:59.559 --> 22:01.279
I knew I could count on you.

22:01.599 --> 22:02.200
Here, here.

22:02.200 --> 22:02.839
I'll carry that for you.

22:03.119 --> 22:03.960
Have some sense.

22:03.960 --> 22:04.440
Take it.

22:05.599 --> 22:06.160
Honestly,

22:06.400 --> 22:07.680
what good are men?

22:08.119 --> 22:09.920
All they do is pick on you.

22:11.359 --> 22:13.799
I heard this year's top scholar
is among the inspectors.

22:13.799 --> 22:14.560
(Yu Jingxiu, Compiler
of the Hanlin Academy)

22:15.480 --> 22:16.279
You've seen a lot of the world.

22:18.440 --> 22:19.519
Have you ever met a top scholar?

22:25.360 --> 22:27.680
(Yu Jingxiu, Junior Sixth Rank,
Compiler of the Hanlin Academy)

22:28.039 --> 22:29.519
The court sends inspectors

22:30.359 --> 22:31.759
to evaluate military officers

22:32.079 --> 22:33.279
on conduct, diligence, ability,
and performance.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.799
As long as I pass the inspection,

22:35.319 --> 22:36.799
once my military merit is reported
to the court,

22:37.160 --> 22:38.920
I'll become a junior fifth-rank
deputy battalion commander.

22:41.720 --> 22:43.200
From junior fifth to senior fifth,

22:43.559 --> 22:44.319
the path gets much easier.

22:47.839 --> 22:49.359
But the merit for those warhorses

22:50.119 --> 22:51.960
was reported nearly six months ago,

22:52.680 --> 22:54.279
and the court still hasn't responded.

22:56.519 --> 22:58.039
Jin Yuanbao sent word.

22:58.200 --> 23:00.279
After Yu Jingxiu became the top scholar,

23:00.279 --> 23:01.240
he entered the Hanlin Academy

23:01.599 --> 23:03.119
and became a compiler.

23:04.359 --> 23:05.680
What does it have to do
with an inspection?

23:06.759 --> 23:08.400
His showing up in Ganlin Town now

23:08.640 --> 23:10.240
probably means he's up to no good.

23:12.160 --> 23:13.559
You've never dealt with him.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.039
Back in Huaying,

23:15.039 --> 23:16.079
he hid his true intentions well.

23:16.920 --> 23:18.440
He's not someone to underestimate.

23:20.240 --> 23:20.839
Doesn't matter.

23:22.799 --> 23:24.440
Whatever he throws at us,
we'll deal with it.

23:25.200 --> 23:26.640
I'd like to see

23:27.000 --> 23:28.640
what he's really up to.

23:31.560 --> 23:34.160
(Ganlin Town)

23:37.559 --> 23:38.160
Young Master.

23:38.440 --> 23:39.200
All this fanfare

23:39.200 --> 23:40.319
must be for the top scholar,

23:40.319 --> 23:40.960
you.

23:41.160 --> 23:41.799
Too noisy.

23:44.799 --> 23:46.039
Find a quieter way around.

23:53.119 --> 23:54.000
What's going on?

23:54.720 --> 23:55.599
Looks like

23:55.680 --> 23:57.559
a cart up ahead got stuck.

24:02.319 --> 24:03.119
One more time.

24:05.039 --> 24:05.839
The cart's stuck?

24:07.480 --> 24:07.960
Come on.

24:07.960 --> 24:08.559
Let's help.

24:08.640 --> 24:09.039
All right.

24:11.839 --> 24:12.519
Thank you.

24:12.839 --> 24:13.440
Together.

24:13.440 --> 24:14.759
One, two, three.

24:15.200 --> 24:15.960
Here we go.

24:18.440 --> 24:19.519
Thank you, sir.

24:19.960 --> 24:21.000
I appreciate it.

24:21.640 --> 24:22.200
Thank you.

24:24.680 --> 24:25.720
Want to wash your hands?

24:26.319 --> 24:26.720
Here.

24:50.039 --> 24:51.160
How you doing?

24:53.640 --> 24:54.400
It's you.

24:57.759 --> 24:58.279
Let's go.

25:07.039 --> 25:07.839
Lord Liu,

25:08.000 --> 25:09.599
this is only part of our grain reserve.

25:09.599 --> 25:10.400
More

25:10.400 --> 25:11.640
will be brought in later.

25:14.640 --> 25:15.880
Very good.

25:16.440 --> 25:17.759
Supplies may be scarce,

25:17.759 --> 25:18.920
but they're well managed.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.079
My Lords,

25:20.720 --> 25:21.519
this is

25:21.599 --> 25:24.039
the list of officers up for promotion.

25:25.119 --> 25:26.440
The officer in charge
of military supplies

25:26.519 --> 25:27.319
is surnamed Zhao.

25:27.720 --> 25:29.319
He's been credited with merit as well.

25:29.400 --> 25:31.839
Please review the records.

25:35.360 --> 25:37.000
(Zhao Ling, Company Commander,
Ganlin Left Garrison)

25:37.480 --> 25:38.480
Commander Zhao...

25:40.440 --> 25:41.599
(Zhao Ling, Company Commander)
what is he like?

25:42.799 --> 25:43.440
My Lord,

25:43.839 --> 25:45.000
his name is Zhao Ling.

25:45.279 --> 25:46.519
His fiancee is Miss Xie.

25:46.759 --> 25:47.839
The two of them

25:47.839 --> 25:48.680
are quite well known in Ganlin.

25:52.920 --> 25:53.920
Commander Zhao

25:54.599 --> 25:55.920
has been in the army less than a year,

25:56.599 --> 25:57.440
yet he's already risen

25:57.440 --> 25:58.960
from a senior seventh-rank
banner commander

25:59.079 --> 26:01.160
to a junior fifth-rank
deputy battalion commander.

26:01.720 --> 26:03.200
A rise that fast

26:03.599 --> 26:05.039
is certainly unusual.

26:10.400 --> 26:11.480
Young Lord Yu,

26:12.119 --> 26:14.519
his record lays it all out clearly.

26:15.319 --> 26:16.440
Commander Zhao

26:16.519 --> 26:18.960
first solved the army's salt shortage,

26:19.200 --> 26:21.200
then captured dozens of fine warhorses.

26:21.799 --> 26:22.920
Those are hardly

26:23.000 --> 26:24.799
ordinary accomplishments.

26:26.240 --> 26:27.480
Indeed.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.400
Speaking of salt...

26:32.119 --> 26:33.079
To be frank, Commander Wang,

26:33.759 --> 26:35.240
my family comes
from Yongning Prefecture.

26:36.160 --> 26:37.480
There's a notorious salt smuggler there

26:38.200 --> 26:39.200
known as Jiuweijiao.

26:39.920 --> 26:40.680
His real name

26:42.359 --> 26:43.680
is also Zhao Ling.

26:44.920 --> 26:47.160
He just happens
to share Commander Zhao's name

26:47.559 --> 26:48.640
and hometown.

26:54.279 --> 26:57.160
Perhaps it's simply a coincidence.

26:59.720 --> 27:01.880
There's something you may not know,
Young Lord Yu.

27:03.160 --> 27:04.519
When Commander Zhao

27:04.799 --> 27:06.519
enlisted,

27:06.640 --> 27:08.599
he carried an imperial letter
of introduction.

27:10.279 --> 27:11.079
With His Majesty himself

27:11.079 --> 27:13.200
vouching for him,

27:13.480 --> 27:14.960
even if he did have

27:15.039 --> 27:16.200
some connection

27:16.200 --> 27:17.519
to that salt smuggler,

27:18.839 --> 27:20.640
surely it wouldn't matter.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.359
Zhao Ling.

27:38.079 --> 27:40.279
The inspector came all this way,

27:41.119 --> 27:44.480
and yours is the only name he circled.

27:45.160 --> 27:46.960
Do you have some history

27:47.160 --> 27:48.720
with Young Lord Yu?

27:52.279 --> 27:53.519
I'm an uneducated soldier.

27:54.839 --> 27:56.200
I have no ties

27:58.799 --> 27:59.680
to officials from the capital.

28:07.920 --> 28:10.079
I can choose not to ask about your past.

28:11.480 --> 28:14.319
But the inspector
has flagged your record.

28:14.559 --> 28:16.720
If you can't get past this yourself,

28:17.839 --> 28:19.440
there's nothing I can do for you.

28:36.559 --> 28:37.200
Commander Zhao.

28:39.759 --> 28:41.079
Thank you for the water earlier.

28:43.079 --> 28:44.200
No need to thank me, Young Lord Yu.

28:45.119 --> 28:46.039
Had I known it was you,

28:47.359 --> 28:48.079
I wouldn't have offered.

28:49.240 --> 28:49.880
Commander Zhao,

28:51.279 --> 28:53.240
that imperial letter may fool the army,

28:54.759 --> 28:56.119
but it doesn't fool me.

28:57.319 --> 28:58.519
Does His Majesty know

28:59.200 --> 29:00.559
that you and Miss Fu

29:00.920 --> 29:02.359
aren't the respectable couple
you claim to be,

29:03.039 --> 29:04.039
but a pair of lovers

29:04.559 --> 29:06.799
who ran away together in disgrace?

29:07.359 --> 29:08.799
How did you manage to deceive
His Majesty

29:08.799 --> 29:09.519
into vouching for you

29:09.519 --> 29:10.839
and getting you into the army?

29:11.000 --> 29:12.079
That's deceiving the Emperor.

29:16.079 --> 29:17.480
Watch your words, Young Lord Yu.

29:18.079 --> 29:19.440
My fiancee

29:19.880 --> 29:20.920
comes from a respectable family.

29:21.599 --> 29:22.519
Our marriage

29:22.519 --> 29:23.880
was approved by our elders.

29:24.559 --> 29:26.319
You're deliberately slandering her

29:26.519 --> 29:27.599
by claiming she's

29:28.200 --> 29:28.960
Miss Fu.

29:30.640 --> 29:31.759
Do you have any proof?

29:34.079 --> 29:35.680
I'm afraid if I produce the proof,

29:36.759 --> 29:38.359
it'll ruin Miss Fu's reputation,

29:38.960 --> 29:40.160
and then you won't dare admit
who she is.

29:41.759 --> 29:42.480
After all, she and I

29:43.400 --> 29:46.279
once met as a prospective match
with our elders present.

29:46.480 --> 29:47.640
She was certainly beautiful.

29:48.559 --> 29:49.359
But

29:50.119 --> 29:51.359
her character was beneath contempt.

29:51.759 --> 29:53.000
I wanted nothing to do with her.

29:56.000 --> 29:57.160
You know exactly

29:57.160 --> 29:58.720
what you did.

29:59.799 --> 30:01.960
And you still have the nerve
to smear her name?

30:03.240 --> 30:04.119
If it wasn't Zuo Junjie,

30:04.119 --> 30:05.119
then it was Zhao Junjie.

30:05.119 --> 30:07.079
Either way, she still ran off
with a man.

30:09.279 --> 30:10.200
So the accusation wasn't far off.

30:16.440 --> 30:18.440
Assaulting an imperial official?

30:19.839 --> 30:21.480
Do you ever want to return
to the capital?

30:43.680 --> 30:45.319
You're a beast in fine clothes.

30:51.240 --> 30:53.000
Ganlin Town is like a swamp.

30:55.920 --> 30:58.200
You have to walk over corpses
to carve a path forward.

30:58.319 --> 30:59.759
Ten lifetimes won't be enough
to get ahead.

31:01.200 --> 31:01.920
Coincidentally,

31:03.279 --> 31:04.640
you've run right into me.

31:05.359 --> 31:06.279
Want to turn things around?

31:07.319 --> 31:08.119
That's a bit difficult.

31:27.960 --> 31:28.599
Commander Zhao.

31:28.839 --> 31:29.720
Commander Wang gave orders.

31:29.920 --> 31:30.640
In three days,

31:30.880 --> 31:32.440
Young Lord Yu will inspect the stables.

31:32.960 --> 31:33.720
He wants you

31:33.720 --> 31:34.440
to prepare in advance

31:34.880 --> 31:35.720
for the inspection.

31:39.160 --> 31:39.880
Understood.

31:49.440 --> 31:50.640
Keep moving!

31:51.119 --> 31:52.640
Keep up, girls!

31:52.839 --> 31:53.720
Stop fooling around.

31:53.799 --> 31:54.640
Hurry up!

31:54.720 --> 31:56.440
Come on! A sandstorm's coming. Hurry!

31:56.440 --> 31:57.359
The wind's picking up!

31:57.680 --> 31:58.559
Come on!

31:58.640 --> 31:59.519
- Hurry up!
- Let's go!

32:00.240 --> 32:00.559
Go!

32:00.559 --> 32:01.200
Come on!

32:01.799 --> 32:03.039
Don't fall behind!

32:31.960 --> 32:33.759
(Ganlin Town is like a swamp.)

32:34.799 --> 32:36.960
(You have to walk over corpses
to carve a path forward.)

32:38.039 --> 32:39.640
(Ten lifetimes won't be enough
to get ahead.)

33:00.359 --> 33:02.519
If Ganlin is a swamp, as you say,

33:06.799 --> 33:08.400
then you can sink in it yourself.

33:10.920 --> 33:11.680
Yucheng.

33:11.920 --> 33:12.480
Yes?

33:12.839 --> 33:14.279
Find someone discreet.

33:16.319 --> 33:19.000
Have him loosen two nails
in the stable roof.

33:20.599 --> 33:21.640
A sandstorm is coming.

33:26.720 --> 33:28.319
It'll all look like an act of nature.

33:31.680 --> 33:33.359
(Advisory Hall)

33:33.359 --> 33:35.039
Young Lord Yu, welcome.

33:35.279 --> 33:36.559
Forgive me for not greeting you sooner.

33:36.559 --> 33:37.559
Young Lord Yu.

33:38.079 --> 33:39.400
Advisor Li,
you're a fourth-rank official.

33:39.400 --> 33:40.920
Why are you bowing

33:40.920 --> 33:41.880
to a sixth-rank official like me?

33:42.880 --> 33:44.839
You're inspecting the frontier
on your father's behalf.

33:45.240 --> 33:46.920
Your word

33:47.119 --> 33:49.119
carries Lord Yu's authority.

33:50.559 --> 33:52.200
Since you understand how this works,

33:52.440 --> 33:53.559
I'll get straight to the point.

33:55.559 --> 33:56.359
I've heard

33:59.039 --> 34:00.240
you have three offenses to your name.

34:01.680 --> 34:02.400
First,

34:03.000 --> 34:04.160
you withheld military funds,

34:04.160 --> 34:05.519
leaving the troops short on supplies

34:05.519 --> 34:06.480
and even without salt.

34:06.799 --> 34:07.599
Second,

34:08.239 --> 34:09.559
you seized civilian farmland,

34:09.559 --> 34:11.719
prompting over a hundred people
to file a joint petition.

34:11.840 --> 34:12.559
Third,

34:13.679 --> 34:15.239
you had an illicit affair with a widow.

34:15.960 --> 34:16.840
Young Lord Yu, I...

34:16.840 --> 34:17.159
This...

34:19.039 --> 34:20.360
But you also have three achievements.

34:26.679 --> 34:28.280
You built frontier fortifications

34:28.280 --> 34:29.519
and put down unrest
among displaced villagers.

34:31.000 --> 34:32.840
After the Yan family in Yongning fell,

34:34.000 --> 34:35.639
you took over the northwest salt trade.

34:35.800 --> 34:36.559
And the books

34:37.199 --> 34:38.599
have been kept remarkably clean.

34:41.719 --> 34:42.480
My Lord,

34:42.719 --> 34:44.159
if my little operation

34:44.239 --> 34:45.800
is worth your attention,

34:45.880 --> 34:46.360
then

34:46.480 --> 34:48.559
I'm willing to hand over the entire
northwest salt operation

34:49.000 --> 34:50.239
to you

34:50.559 --> 34:51.599
without taking a share for myself.

34:55.920 --> 34:57.199
The Yu family can protect you.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.400
I ask only one thing.

34:59.079 --> 34:59.840
This arrangement

35:01.480 --> 35:02.960
must remain discreet.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.519
Understood.

35:06.400 --> 35:07.199
One more thing.

35:09.199 --> 35:10.239
I hear

35:10.519 --> 35:11.400
a man who enlisted

35:11.400 --> 35:13.840
here in Ganlin this year is named

35:14.440 --> 35:15.239
Zhao Ling.

35:15.679 --> 35:16.760
Zhao Ling?

35:18.079 --> 35:19.199
Yes, that's right.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.880
Zhao Ling has accomplished

35:21.880 --> 35:23.880
something remarkable
these past six months.

35:23.880 --> 35:26.119
He captured thirty fine warhorses.

35:26.320 --> 35:27.519
It's one of the greatest feats

35:27.519 --> 35:29.920
Ganlin has ever seen.

35:30.199 --> 35:32.039
Perhaps they weren't warhorses at all,

35:32.039 --> 35:32.599
but

35:33.480 --> 35:34.519
civilian horses?

35:35.360 --> 35:37.199
Surely you jest, Young Lord Yu.

35:37.480 --> 35:38.599
If they were civilian horses,

35:38.599 --> 35:39.639
that wouldn't be merit.

35:39.719 --> 35:41.679
It would be a capital offense.

35:41.920 --> 35:43.440
Commander Zhao is an honorable man.

35:49.440 --> 35:51.880
Thank you for pointing that out,
Young Lord Yu.

35:53.079 --> 35:54.079
I happen

35:54.079 --> 35:55.599
to know a few horse ranchers.

35:56.559 --> 35:58.119
I'll ask whether

35:58.239 --> 36:00.679
any of them have lost good horses
in the past six months.

36:00.920 --> 36:02.320
And if they all insist

36:02.760 --> 36:05.159
that Zhao Ling stole their horses,

36:05.920 --> 36:08.400
then it won't be some legendary
military feat.

36:08.639 --> 36:09.880
It'll mean Zhao Ling

36:10.000 --> 36:11.760
murdered civilians
and claimed false military credit...

36:12.239 --> 36:13.159
a capital offense.

36:17.920 --> 36:19.840
Plant these civilian horseshoes
in the stable,

36:20.000 --> 36:21.159
and Zhao Ling will be finished.

36:21.480 --> 36:22.440
For something this simple,

36:22.639 --> 36:24.159
I can have someone take care of it.

36:24.400 --> 36:25.880
There's no need for you
to do it yourself.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.079
I hear

36:27.639 --> 36:28.800
there's a sandstorm coming today.

36:29.679 --> 36:31.760
Advisor Li and everyone in the army
keep saying

36:32.840 --> 36:34.320
Zhao Ling has achieved

36:35.199 --> 36:37.079
some extraordinary feat.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.639
I was born into the Yu family
of Yongning.

36:40.360 --> 36:41.920
My father holds high office.

36:43.199 --> 36:44.800
I studied for more than a decade

36:45.239 --> 36:46.599
to place first
in the imperial examination

36:46.920 --> 36:48.280
and earn His Majesty's favor,

36:48.679 --> 36:50.920
yet I'm still only a junior sixth-rank
Hanlin compiler.

36:52.719 --> 36:53.760
And Zhao Ling?

36:55.079 --> 36:56.960
He was a nobody.

36:57.039 --> 36:58.760
He's been in Ganlin for less
than a year,

36:59.800 --> 37:01.599
and he's already risen
to junior fifth rank.

37:06.079 --> 37:07.679
I'd like to see for myself

37:09.239 --> 37:10.320
just what kind

37:11.400 --> 37:13.920
of extraordinary feat
he supposedly pulled off.

37:22.160 --> 37:23.840
(Horse Garrison)

37:23.840 --> 37:24.559
Young Lord Yu.

37:24.760 --> 37:25.960
Commander Zhao sent men

37:25.960 --> 37:27.000
to take inventory a few days ago.

37:27.159 --> 37:28.440
But with a sandstorm coming today,

37:28.519 --> 37:30.840
all the horses must
be moved underground for shelter.

37:31.039 --> 37:32.880
I'm afraid you won't be able
to inspect them today.

37:33.039 --> 37:33.639
That's fine.

37:34.559 --> 37:36.199
I'll wait here until the storm passes.

37:37.440 --> 37:38.599
Go tell Commander Zhao

37:39.679 --> 37:41.400
I'll conduct a preliminary inspection
today.

37:42.039 --> 37:42.639
Another day,

37:43.119 --> 37:44.880
I'll return with the other officials
for a full inspection.

37:45.159 --> 37:45.599
Yes, sir.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.400
Hide them well.

37:52.679 --> 37:53.159
Yes.

38:01.760 --> 38:02.880
Why is the storm here so soon?

38:22.679 --> 38:23.960
Miss Xie, slow down!

38:26.719 --> 38:27.960
Miss Xie, slow down!

38:36.880 --> 38:37.519
Miss Xie.

38:38.079 --> 38:39.519
I think someone's in the stable.

38:41.599 --> 38:43.000
I'll go check.

38:43.000 --> 38:43.519
Sanniang,

38:43.519 --> 38:44.559
go get help.

38:44.559 --> 38:45.320
Wait, Miss Xie!

39:20.119 --> 39:21.079
You?

39:21.800 --> 39:22.960
What are you doing here?

39:25.440 --> 39:26.559
Why did you save me?

39:27.320 --> 39:29.119
Do you know what really happened
back in Huaying...?

39:29.239 --> 39:30.480
Shut your mouth.

39:46.000 --> 39:47.119
Push!

39:48.199 --> 39:49.239
Push!

39:57.679 --> 39:58.480
Mr. Zhao!

39:58.480 --> 39:58.920
What are you doing here?

39:58.920 --> 39:59.559
Miss Xie!

39:59.559 --> 40:00.719
She came to get the bamboo slips.

40:00.719 --> 40:01.920
The stable collapsed,

40:01.920 --> 40:02.719
and she went inside to save someone!

40:02.719 --> 40:03.400
Hurry!

40:03.400 --> 40:04.400
Go check on her!

40:05.159 --> 40:05.760
No.

40:06.800 --> 40:07.400
Mr. Zhao!

40:23.800 --> 40:25.119
Why did you really save me?

40:26.000 --> 40:27.559
I'd even help a stray dog

40:28.000 --> 40:28.960
if I found it hurt by the roadside.

40:29.920 --> 40:31.239
Besides, I need you alive

40:31.719 --> 40:32.800
to sign that written confession.

40:33.360 --> 40:35.199
Does that confession really mean
that much to you?

40:36.480 --> 40:37.800
One wrong move today,

40:38.519 --> 40:39.760
and you could've died here too.

40:40.800 --> 40:42.280
Dying alongside someone you hate...

40:43.199 --> 40:43.960
was that worth it?

40:48.440 --> 40:48.960
Tingyun.

40:49.679 --> 40:50.280
Tingyun!

40:51.000 --> 40:51.559
Tingyun!

40:52.400 --> 40:53.079
Tingyun!

40:56.519 --> 40:57.239
Mr. Zhao!

41:01.000 --> 41:01.679
Mr. Zhao!

41:03.719 --> 41:04.280
Tingyun!

41:06.599 --> 41:07.199
Mr. Zhao.

41:07.199 --> 41:07.719
Are you all right?

41:09.320 --> 41:10.119
I'm fine.

41:34.440 --> 41:35.440
The storm just passed.

41:36.679 --> 41:37.320
You...

41:39.119 --> 41:40.119
Go home and wait for me.

41:40.400 --> 41:41.280
I'll be back soon.

41:44.400 --> 41:44.960
Sanniang.

41:47.400 --> 41:48.960
Miss Xie, are you hurt?

41:49.800 --> 41:50.360
Let's go home.

41:51.079 --> 41:51.760
Come on.

41:51.920 --> 41:52.719
Let's get you home.

42:10.440 --> 42:11.840
Ganlin's military stables

42:11.840 --> 42:13.440
have always been built like a fortress.

42:14.639 --> 42:16.159
Funny how they collapsed
the moment I arrived.

42:16.639 --> 42:18.119
Can you look her in the eye

42:18.199 --> 42:19.239
and swear to Heaven

42:19.239 --> 42:20.320
that you had nothing to do with this?

42:20.480 --> 42:21.599
Can you swear

42:23.199 --> 42:24.239
you didn't tamper with it?

42:29.639 --> 42:31.880
You came all the way here in a sandstorm

42:32.320 --> 42:33.639
just to plant this

42:33.639 --> 42:34.440
and frame me!

42:54.920 --> 42:57.000
She was born a lady of a noble house.

42:58.840 --> 43:00.480
Now she wears rough clothes
and eats plain food,

43:00.960 --> 43:02.840
her hands scarred from hard labor,

43:02.840 --> 43:04.639
no different from the farm women
of Ganlin.

43:08.039 --> 43:09.320
I have only one question.

43:11.760 --> 43:12.599
Why

43:13.639 --> 43:15.440
would you let a jewel like her be buried
in the dust?

43:21.200 --> 43:23.760
(Next Episode)

43:50.199 --> 43:51.440
Tingyun.

43:52.440 --> 43:53.400
I want to ask you something.

43:55.840 --> 43:57.320
When we're married someday,

43:58.559 --> 44:00.000
what kind of couple
do you hope we'll be?

44:14.680 --> 44:19.000
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

44:22.600 --> 44:26.960
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

44:29.080 --> 44:33.720
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

44:33.960 --> 44:36.760
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

44:37.920 --> 44:42.560
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

44:45.760 --> 44:52.600
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

44:53.480 --> 45:00.000
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

45:00.960 --> 45:04.400
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:04.920 --> 45:09.120
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:09.400 --> 45:15.080
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

45:27.200 --> 45:31.080
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

45:35.000 --> 45:39.000
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

45:40.720 --> 45:45.400
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

45:45.720 --> 45:48.400
♪Kept close within my heart♪

45:49.480 --> 45:54.320
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

45:57.840 --> 46:04.760
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:05.640 --> 46:12.120
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

46:13.000 --> 46:16.520
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:16.960 --> 46:21.320
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:21.520 --> 46:27.240
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
